{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-0a8fa7f42b0c", "start_time": "2026-09-21T21:35:56.221Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 2, "timestamp": "2026-09-21T21:36:06.849Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 14313, "tokens_out": 341, "latency": 0.2648, "finish_reason": "end_turn"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "Summarise the latest adjuster correspondence on TM-2026-0031 and note any actions for me.", "prompt_hash": "sha256:1e71e3db532fd37c80586d49b6d176f6768cd9003544b41878714e4a703505fe", "response_text": "**Summary of TM-2026-0031: Latest position**\n\nThe file note ends 24 June 2026. The most recent substantive adjuster input is the Ashgrove Adjusting report (AA/26/4471, received 14 May 2026), which established the cause as a failed push-fit connector from a 2023 bathroom refit. The escape of water peril responds because the failure was sudden, not gradual.\n\n**Work completed:**\n- Drying verified by Redwell Restoration\n- Reinstatement completed; policyholder confirmed kitchen unit replacement acceptable (3 June)\n- Redwell invoice (£18,144.48) authorised and paid (24 June)\n- Subrogation against the refit contractor not pursued (firm dissolved 2024)\n\n**Current status:**\nThe claim is open with £21,700 reserve and £18,144 paid. There are no outstanding actions recorded in the file note since June.\n\n**Actions for you:**\n1. **Check for recent correspondence** — The last file note entry is from June; establish whether there has been any further adjuster contact, policyholder claim, or recovery activity since then that should be documented.\n2. **Review reserve adequacy** — With £18,144 paid against a £21,700 reserve, confirm whether the remaining reserve of circa £3,556 is appropriate or whether the file should be closed if all work is done.\n\nWould you like me to note these actions in the case file?", "response_hash": "sha256:076bdc30b55a287144f2ae53f864a04a93c26a0e260d8b067d729c669ca19d93", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
